# DevOps Learning Repo

## OverTheWire Bandit Wargame
Working through the Bandit wargame as part of my DevOps/Cloud Engineering learning journey. Each file documents the commands used and the approach taken to complete that level.

## Skills Covered (Levels 0-17)
- SSH into remote servers
- Navigating the Linux file system (ls, cd, cat, find)
- Reading hidden files and files with special names
- Searching files by size, permissions and content (find, grep)
- File permissions and ownership (chmod, ls -la)
- File compression and decompression (gzip, bzip2, tar)
- Hex dumps and reversing them (xxd)
- Netcat for connecting to open ports (nc)
- SSL/TLS connections (openssl s_client)
- Port scanning (nmap)
- Private key authentication (SSH -i)

## Progress
- Levels 0-17 completed and documented

